Spec: SpecDD Plan Augmentation

Purpose:
  Add current Change Boundary impact to `speckit.plan` while preserving the upstream planning workflow.

Owns:
  ./plan.md

References:
  ../../specdd/commands/context.sdd

Must:
  Planning refreshes SpecDD context once concrete or intended implementation paths are available.
  The plan records a concise SpecDD impact summary without copying persistent constraint text.
  Early unresolved targets remain advisory and never become authority.
  Anticipated authority evolution requires a separate specification operation and later re-resolution.

Done when:
  The composed planning command includes upstream planning behavior and the SpecDD planning augmentation.
